    "committer": "Joshua D. Campbell <joshua.d.campbell@gmail.com>",
    "message": "Derive vignette cluster-to-cell-type mapping programmatically\n\nThe hardcoded cellTypeMappings cluster numbers depended on the exact\nheuristic clustering output, which varies across decontX versions and\nplatforms (BiocCheck CI failed with 'groupClusters not found in z: 6'\nunder Bioc devel). Assign each cell type to the cluster where its\nmarkers are most frequently detected instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
